---
import SeoGuideLayout from '../../layouts/SeoGuideLayout.astro';
import { SEO_INTROS } from '../../data/seo-intros';
---

<SeoGuideLayout
  pathname="/palworld-item-spawner/"
  breadcrumbLabel="Item spawner"
  intro={SEO_INTROS['/palworld-item-spawner/']!}
>
  <h2>Palworld item spawner tools</h2>
  <p>
    Trainers expose searchable item lists; mod menus filter by category. For server admins, Palworld spawn item
    commands remain the most portable approach when joining friends who disallow client-side spawners.
  </p>
  <h2>Palworld item list highlights</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Spheres, weapons and armor tiers for PvP tests</li>
    <li>Lifmunk Effigy and stat fruit for breeding labs</li>
    <li>Jetragon and endgame Pal eggs for sandbox worlds</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Palworld spawn item command tips</h2>
  <p>
    Cross-check IDs after each Pocketpair balance pass—duplicate names exist across tech tiers. Export your table
    when 1.0.6 drops so you can diff changes quickly.
  </p>
</SeoGuideLayout>
